# .chroot only, no .binary counterpart - this repo is never configured
# in the shipped image, only during the build so
# hooks/live/0400-install-ezio.hook.chroot can install the ezio .deb.
#
# Plain http, not https: live-build applies this archive before the
# chroot has ca-certificates installed, so an https URL here fails
# closed on a TLS trust error before apt ever gets to check the GPG
# signature. drbl.key.chroot is what actually authenticates this repo -
# TLS was never load-bearing.
deb http://free.nchc.org.tw/drbl-core drbl live-sid
